  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 190°C. Soften the onion and carrots in olive oil in an ovenproof pan for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and tomato purée, cook for a minute, then stir in the tomatoes, oregano, sugar and a splash of water.",
    "Fold in the butter beans, season generously and bring to a simmer.",
    "Transfer to the oven and bake uncovered for 35 minutes until the top is bronzed and the sauce is jammy.",
    "Finish with chopped dill, a flood of good olive oil and a squeeze of lemon. Best with crusty bread."
  ],
  "notes": "Don't rush the bake — the edges catching and caramelising are what make this dish. Even better at room temperature the next day."
}
